  "summary": "I’m a Lead Software Engineer focused on building backend systems, production platforms, APIs, and full-stack internal tools. My work spans system design, cloud-native architecture, workflow automation, observability, sensitive-data handling, and data-intensive application development across AWS-based environments.\n\nI primarily work with Python, AWS, SQL, FastAPI, React, TypeScript, Terraform, Spark, and Databricks. I enjoy taking ambiguous problems from idea to production, especially when they involve designing reliable systems, improving internal platforms, and building tools that make complex workflows easier for users.\n\nI’m especially interested in Senior Software Engineer, Backend Engineer, Platform Engineer, and Internal Tools/Product Engineering roles where I can build scalable services, improve platform capabilities, and solve high-impact technical problems.",
